## 4. Abort rules
A failed pass criterion = stop, no improvising. Before W-9 everything is reversible by resume + scale up. Never: `kubectl apply` a repo app, `flux reconcile` after a merge, remove a claimRef, patch any PV but `<PV>`, `Delete` early, delete PV/Longhorn volume, `--force`, edit RD `trigger.manual` while the ks runs, touch the app PV to fix the drill, a bare `gh pr merge`.

